msgid ""
"Read what other guests said — and if you enjoyed the ride, a few words from "
"you help others find us."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:485 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:508
msgid "Where to find us"
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:487 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:510
msgid "Open daily, 09:00–18:00."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:488 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:518
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:556 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:557
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:579
msgid "Map showing the location of our business"
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:489 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:512
msgid ""
"You will find us on the sand at Praia do Carvoeiro — just look for the boats."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:493 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:516
msgid ""
"Booking ahead is kindest: it means we can save you a seat on the boat you "
"want."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:512 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:535
msgid ""
"Reservations, questions, or a tip about the sea that day — message us and we "
"will answer."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:532 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:570
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:571 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:593
msgid "Carvoeiro & Benagil in panorama"
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:534 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:573
msgid ""
"Take the photograph by its edge and pull: the view turns the way it does "
"from the boat."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:544 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:567
msgid "Calls to a Portuguese mobile may be charged by your operator."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:546 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:586
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:587 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:610
msgid "Carvoeiro beach"
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:554 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:596
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:597 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:621
msgid "Benagil cave"
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:566 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:610
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:611 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:636
msgid "Drag to look around"
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:572 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:595
msgid ""
"Drag the photograph sideways, from the beach at Carvoeiro to the roof of the "
"Benagil cave."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:630 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:656
msgid "Praia do Carvoeiro, with free transport to Ferragudo"
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:633 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:659
msgid "Weather permitting, we stop by a beach for a swim along the way."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:637 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:663
msgid ""
"We meet you at Praia do Carvoeiro and drive you to Ferragudo, where the boat "
"is waiting. From there it is two hours of cliffs, caves and open water."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:641 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:667
msgid ""
"We are a small team who grew up on this coast. We know which cave is worth "
"the detour and where the dolphins usually are — and we will tell you the "
"stories behind both."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:645 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:671
msgid ""
"We head out to the dolphins' feeding grounds first, then turn back along the "
"coast: Praia da Marinha, Algar de Benagil, Olhos de Deus, the largest cave "
"in the Algarve, and a few places with no name at all."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:649 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:675
msgid ""
"Our skippers talk about the marine life and the local ecosystem as we go, so "
"you leave knowing more than when you stepped aboard."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:656 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:682
msgid ""
"The speedboat is not suitable for people with serious back problems, anyone "
"weighing more than 120 kg, or late-stage pregnancy."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:661 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:687
msgid "Life jacket, and waterproof bags when the sea asks for them."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:666 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:692
msgid "Swimsuit, towel, sun cream and sunglasses — bring your own."
msgstr ""

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:671 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:697
msgid "Cancel at least 24 hours before departure for a full refund."
msgstr ""
